[260.455406, "o", "\u001b[33m484f5ae\u001b[m\u001b[33m (\u001b[m\u001b[1;36mHEAD -> \u001b[m\u001b[1;32mmaster\u001b[m\u001b[33m)\u001b[m BugSwarm patches; use 'git reset --hard 28722c52329753324ac4615d7aeae85d66c88461' to revert\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m28722c5\u001b[m Merge a85a01b5acdd25eb290af9c12d4b15c34f00223d into 1ba4c40596f887f5040a60cd407b94751d65589f\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33ma85a01b\u001b[m Quiesce the continuous integration builds a bit by running maven in batch mode (reducing chatter from download progress logging)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m76b1a74\u001b[m Fix travis failures by moving to container-based travis which doesn't invoke the OpenJDK7 bug in getHostAddress (which crashes the VM during GWT tests)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m1ce34b6\u001b[m Publish the hitherto internal AutoValue guide as value/userguide.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33me9345ec\u001b[m Add stronger scare-text to the javadoc for AutoValueExtension. The intent is to allow a 1.2 release without having to finalize this API. ------------- C\u001b[m \b\u001b[33m\u001b[mreated by MOE: https://github.com/google/moe MOE_MIGRATED_REVID=110406055\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33mf4ae374\u001b[m Make it an error for an @AutoValue property to be @Nullable and "]
[260.455434, "o", "have "]
[260.455502, "o", "primitive type.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33mf37401e\u001b[m Make AnnotationValues public.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33mde66f23\u001b[m Fixing AutoValue support for nullable properties using copyOf. This should work properly for @Nullable primitive properties.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m82cd13b\u001b[m Automated g4 rollback of changelist 109206967.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33mdebd32d\u001b[m Fix AutoValue builders to support nullable properties using copyOf behavior without passing null to copyOf. ImmutableList.copyOf, for example, thows an \u001b[m \b\u001b[33m\u001b[mNPE when passed a null.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m1d5ba03\u001b[m Extend EclipseHack with code that means that we can handle inheriting generic methods from interfaces.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m58ef8e1\u001b[m Package com.google.* classes under autovalue.shaded.com.google.*\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m468d866\u001b[m Add a link to the AutoValue user's guide in the AutoValueProcessor\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33me13c955\u001b[m Improve the logic of MoreTypes.equivalence() so that it no longer considers that Set<Set<Object>> is the same as Set<Set<String>>.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m2934a31\u001b[m Fix a bug where AutoValue generated incorrect code if a method with a g"]
[260.455532, "o", "eneric p"]
[260.455631, "o", "arameter was inherited by a class that supplies a concrete type for that \u001b[m \b\u001b[33m\u001b[mparameter. For example `StringIterator implements Iterator<String>`, where the type of `next()` is String, not T.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33macd2efb\u001b[m Fix the javadoc of AutoValueExtension, based on the changes in https://github.com/google/auto/pull/285 by rharter.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33mf8801fb\u001b[m Allow an AutoValue.Builder type to define both `void setStrings(ImmutableList<Strings>)` and `ImmutableList.Builder<Strings> stringsBuilder()`.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m59d9bad\u001b[m Minor fixes to the README.md\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33mb5ebc92\u001b[m Suppress new CollectionIncompatibleType Error Prone check by casting incompatibly-typed argument to query methods in generic collection types. This will\u001b[m \b\u001b[33m\u001b[m enable us to make this pattern an error in error-prone preventing future occurrences of this bug.\u001b[m\r\n"]
